{"4710460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "四方行", "steam_appid": 4710460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4741720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A thousand-mile journey begins with a single copper coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Four Directions is a merchant trading game set in ancient China. You play as a roaming trader starting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  from Chang'an in the northwest, passing through Bianliang, Pingyang, Wuchang, and Jincheng, heading south to Jinling, Gusu, and Yangzhou,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  venturing deep into Kunming, Fuliang, and Panyu — bargaining and trading across a network of cities and towns, building your fortune through wit and words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Bargaining &amp; Negotiation】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every deal is a contest of minds. Different cities, different merchants — each with their own wants and limits. Learn what they need, read the moment, and strike at the right price. Buy low, sell smart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Trade Routes &amp; Regional Goods】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Datong iron, Gusu silk, Fuliang porcelain, Panyu agarwood — every region has its abundance and its scarcity. Buy where it's cheap, sell where it's scarce. Plan your route and bring the right goods to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Workshops &amp; Crafting】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Turn raw materials into finished goods at forges, weaving halls, kitchens, and apothecaries. As your craft rank rises, so does the quality — and value — of what you produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Appraisal: Spot the Real Deal】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The market is full of fakes and forgeries. That item you picked up for a song — is it worthless junk or a priceless antique? Only a sharp eye can tell. Identify a genuine treasure and its value can soar overnight. Guess wrong, and the loss is yours to bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Hidden Places, Waiting to Be Found】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Rumors travel fast on the road. There are places that don't appear on ordinary maps, sheltering goods and opportunities found nowhere else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   — where exactly? Travel far enough, and you'll find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ▎ &quot;Goods flow in all four directions; prosperity follows.&quot;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710460/extras/4d5ddbaf4345ddb1750cff6d61c51ac5.avif?t=1784163838\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710460/extras_big/4d5ddbaf4345ddb1750cff6d61c51ac5.avif?t=1784163838 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A thousand-mile journey begins with a single copper coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Four Directions is a merchant trading game set in ancient China. You play as a roaming trader starting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  from Chang'an in the northwest, passing through Bianliang, Pingyang, Wuchang, and Jincheng, heading south to Jinling, Gusu, and Yangzhou,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  venturing deep into Kunming, Fuliang, and Panyu — bargaining and trading across a network of cities and towns, building your fortune through wit and words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Bargaining &amp; Negotiation】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every deal is a contest of minds. Different cities, different merchants — each with their own wants and limits. Learn what they need, read the moment, and strike at the right price. Buy low, sell smart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Trade Routes &amp; Regional Goods】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Datong iron, Gusu silk, Fuliang porcelain, Panyu agarwood — every region has its abundance and its scarcity. Buy where it's cheap, sell where it's scarce. Plan your route and bring the right goods to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Workshops &amp; Crafting】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Turn raw materials into finished goods at forges, weaving halls, kitchens, and apothecaries. As your craft rank rises, so does the quality — and value — of what you produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Appraisal: Spot the Real Deal】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The market is full of fakes and forgeries. That item you picked up for a song — is it worthless junk or a priceless antique? Only a sharp eye can tell. Identify a genuine treasure and its value can soar overnight. Guess wrong, and the loss is yours to bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  【Hidden Places, Waiting to Be Found】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Rumors travel fast on the road. There are places that don't appear on ordinary maps, sheltering goods and opportunities found nowhere else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   — where exactly? Travel far enough, and you'll find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ▎ &quot;Goods flow in all four directions; prosperity follows.&quot;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710460/extras/4d5ddbaf4345ddb1750cff6d61c51ac5.avif?t=1784163838\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710460/extras_big/4d5ddbaf4345ddb1750cff6d61c51ac5.avif?t=1784163838 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "a traveling merchant crosses the land — trading goods, winning trust. Bargain, craft, and appraise your way from the northern frontier to the southern seas, and forge your own legend on the road.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710460/7440000ee9c94468e592e0f3b97f819888261f65/header.jpg?t=1784163838